      },
      {
        "text": "Beyond Laravel, I've built <accent>computer vision pipelines</accent>, <accent>server monitoring tools</accent>, and <accent>AI/ML systems</accent> — giving me a full-stack view of every project I touch. I also handle server infrastructure including <accent>Nginx</accent>, <accent>Certbot SSL</accent>, <accent>Supervisor queue workers</accent>, and <accent>PM2</accent> for production deployments."
